      "coverageState": "NON_ASSESSABLE",
      "nonAssessableReason": "The duty requires appointing a person to attend an annual public information session in person, and attendance recording is maintained in an external session register by the organizer. Software repositories cannot establish or perform physical human attendance at external meetings.",
